Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.80,0:00:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,吉娜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.27,0:00:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,懂了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.69,0:00:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.15,0:00:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,到底該怎麼做？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.69,0:00:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,該怎麼做  才能讓大家都幸福？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.45,0:00:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,才能讓這種事情不再重演？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.54,0:00:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,還是說  這就是所謂的命運？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.67,0:00:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不管重來多少次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.04,0:00:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,都一定得有人犧牲…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.96,0:00:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,尤里…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.38,0:00:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,塞思？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.85,0:00:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我…我沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:00:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,塞思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.44,0:01:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,塞思
