Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.47,0:01:16.37,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:19.09,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}ざばぁん
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.33,0:01:21.91,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}潜伏しながら行こう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:24.53,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Guess Doubt 壊れる思考
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.64,0:01:27.16,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}人の殻破り 突き出る角
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.16,0:01:29.04,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}正気はいらないさ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.04,0:01:30.46,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}I'll take you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.46,0:01:31.79,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}破れハウトゥー
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.79,0:01:34.63,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}笑えるわ 裏切りだらけの生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.63,0:01:35.79,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Bet on me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.79,0:01:38.05,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}吊し上げて堕とす
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.05,0:01:41.58,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}それでは皆 Nice tripを
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.18,0:01:46.27,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}手を伸ばしたその先に幸よあれ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.27,0:01:47.47,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}廻り廻って
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.47,0:01:48.86,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}変わり変わる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.86,0:01:50.96,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}人の形捨て
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.37,0:01:52.62,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.91,0:01:56.40,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}救いよあれ 騙し騙されのゲーム
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.54,0:01:59.93,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}一心不乱にあがいて 切り裂く逆境
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.93,0:02:02.36,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}足元にTake care
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.36,0:02:03.38,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:07.33,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}憂いのない 電脳化されたHeaven
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.49,0:02:09.39,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}一瞬の油断が最後
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.39,0:02:13.23,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}剥ぎ取るよ化けの皮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.23,0:02:16.20,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Get out!
